        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 73,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> signet-ring cells within a background fibromatous stroma; lack of expression of EMA; absence of intracytoplasmic mucin.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T17:08:39"
      }
    ],
